      <rules>
        <rule name="Hypertoxic Miasma" id="a2b6-73c0-f29d-6399" hidden="false">
          <description>At the end of the Assault phase, every enemy unit engaged with the Toxicrene suffers D3 hits at Strength 3, AP –, Poisoned (2+)</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Spore Cloud" id="0451-67f6-bf37-5cfd" hidden="false">
          <description>friendly Tyranid units with at least one model within 6" of a Venomthrope have Shrouded (6+). Enemy units that charge a unit protected by a Spore Cloud count the charge as passing through dangerous terrain</description>
